This plugin is derived from CS Map Sheets (csmap-sheets), also by yo-1,
and reuses its input conversion code for GSI DEM, forestry LEM/grid products,
LAS/LAZ point clouds, and text/raster normalization.

TerrainRGB encoding follows the Forestry Open Data Standard formula:
H = -10000 + (R*256*256 + G*256 + B) * 0.1.
